WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:06.610
While in Australia,

2
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.420
I paid a visit and my respects

3
00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.284
to the National Center of Indigenous Excellence,

4
00:00:10.284 --> 00:00:12.393
where I was honored with the traditional

5
00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:14.294
Welcome to Country ceremony,

6
00:00:14.294 --> 00:00:18.067 line:15%
performed by Uncle Graham King, a Ngiyampaa Elder.

7
00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:20.340
That's a song that comes

8
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.923
straight from this ground here.

9
00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.657
No one represents the new face of Indigenous Australia

10
00:00:28.657 --> 00:00:31.407
quite like Adam Briggs, a rapper,

11
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.660 line:15%
comedy writer, activist

12
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.210 line:15%
and proud member of the Yorta Yorta Nation.

13
00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.120
On my arms I got my tribe, Yorta Yorta.

14
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.480
You're a Yorta Yorta man?

15
00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:46.237
Yeah, and then on my hands is always was, always will be,

16
00:00:46.237 --> 00:00:49.470
which is like a, it's a protest kinda thing.

17
00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.782
It's like always was, always will be Aboriginal land.

18
00:00:51.782 --> 00:00:52.615
Right.

19
00:00:52.615 --> 00:00:53.950
I just got drawn on by my friends,

20
00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:55.343
and they just happen to be great artists.

21
00:00:55.343 --> 00:00:58.300
Right, so all these tattoos happened when you were asleep?

22
00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.133
Yeah.

23
00:00:59.133 --> 00:00:59.966
For the most part.
Yeah.

24
00:00:59.966 --> 00:01:01.170
You woke up, you got lucky.

25
00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:04.170
Yeah, I coulda had a bunch of dicks.

26
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.900
What is it you're trying to accomplish now?

27
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.250
It's about changing the perceptions

28
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.197
of what an indigenous artist can be.

29
00:01:13.197 --> 00:01:14.670
Right, I think you're the future

30
00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.640
of this country, I really do.
Thanks.

31
00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:20.350
And of course my opinion carries no weight here.

32
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:22.319 line:15%
Briggs, good on ya!

33
00:01:23.152 --> 00:01:23.985 line:15%
Good on ya?

34
00:01:23.985 --> 00:01:25.367 line:15%
That's not what they say, no?

35
00:01:26.355 --> 00:01:27.880
It's like patronizing.

36
00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.480
Oh, so I just should have to (bleep) off?

37
00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.313
Yeah, a little bit.

38
00:01:30.313 --> 00:01:31.146
Hey Briggs.

39
00:01:31.146 --> 00:01:31.979
Hey.

40
00:01:31.979 --> 00:01:32.812
Off!
Off, man!

41
00:01:32.812 --> 00:01:33.645
Off!
Off!

42
00:01:34.478 --> 00:01:38.061
Well, I'm the ultimate cultural ambassador.

